;; Ported from OCaml 5.5.0 (the release tarball, SHA-256 fcc6ae665d1ec51d52510eaac7834a86a9806bf5a258bb7cca78733fccf015ba):
;; lambda/matching.ml, the compilation of pattern matching (half-simplification, the or-matrix and the splits, the
;; precompilation of variables and or-patterns, contexts, default environments, jump summaries, the divisions by
;; constants, constructors, tuples and records, the failure actions, the combinations into switches and tests,
;; for_function, for_trywith, for_let, for_multiple_match, for_optional_arg_default), for the patterns of the core
;; language (doc/ocaml/TYPER.md), whose notice follows (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
;;
